!! Making and using importers

An //importer// is JSON Convert with everything hard taken out.  You build
a profile once, here in the Studio, and bake it into a small plugin.
Whoever installs that plugin gets one page: paste JSON, click a button,
review, click the other button.  They never see a profile, a path
expression or a transform.

This guide builds one end to end -- an ''Invoice Importer'' from the
reified-output sample that ships with this wiki -- installs it into an
empty wiki, and shows what the recipient sees, including what happens
when their JSON is not what the importer expects.

